 the options that make the following statements true.\n\nRounded to one decimal place, the test statistic is approximately\n{{field-1}}.\n\nThe number of degrees of freedom for this test is $ν =$ {{field-2}}.\n\nAt the $1%$ significance level, there is {{field-3}} evidence to reject the null hypothesis.\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."}] :knowledge-point/title "Chi-Square Tests for Homogeneity" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050794 :topic/math-academy-id 3317 :topic/title "Chi-Square Tests of Independence and Homogeneity"}]}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186171994 :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172473 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18.25" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170330} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "17.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170331} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "19.375" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170332} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "23.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170333} {:answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "22.5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170334}] :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186170329}] :question/math-academy-id "q-237166" :question/problem "A particular feature is being examined across $3$ groups of individuals to determine if the mean varies by group. The table below shows the values of this feature for three samples, each consisting of $4$ individuals from each group.\n\n| Group 1 | Group 2 | Group 3 |\n| --- | ---: | ---: |\n| $10$ | $9.5$ | $7$ |\n| $9$ | $10.5$ | $10$ |\n| $11$ | $7$ | $11.5$ |\n| $12$ | $8$ | $8.5$ |\n\nWhat is the sum of squares within groups (SSW) for these samples?\n\n> A scientific calculator is required to answer this question."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186172517 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [